    <string name="legal_booking_title">Appointments</string>
    <string name="legal_booking_body">Choose services, a barber, date, and time in the app. Availability is confirmed when you submit. If a time changes, refresh the search.</string>
    <string name="legal_changes_title">Cancellations and changes</string>
    <string name="legal_changes_body">Cancellations and rescheduling follow the minimum notice configured by the barbershop. The API response confirms whether the change was applied.</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_body">We collect the name, phone number, email, profile photo, favorites, reviews, and appointment details you provide. We use them to create your account, manage appointments, and show reviews. The assigned barber receives the details needed to serve your appointment. The app encrypts your session and local appointment copies; the API processes your credentials and bookings. Photos are stored in Azure Blob or the database, depending on service configuration. We do not sell your data or use it for advertising. You can correct your details in My profile or request deletion in Settings; your account is anonymized and previous appointments are kept without identifying you. Current reminders are scheduled on your device.</string>
    <string name="legal_terms_title">Terms of use</string>
    <string name="legal_terms_body">When booking, you confirm that your details and selected times are correct. The barbershop may update prices, availability, and conditions; the app shows current information received from the API.</string>
